<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch13-04--grok--data-existence> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Data existence of thompson1917-ch13-04 by Grok 4.7: 0.5";
